  speakerName: Marco
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  portugueseText: "Ah, um pouco dos dois, mas eu realmente me interesso por isso.
    E falta gente que estude Hist\xF3ria aqui, as pessoas ignoram o nosso passado,
    e repetem os mesmos erros."
  englishText: "A bit of both, but I'm genuinely interested in History. There aren\u2019t
    enough people studying it here, most people ignore our past, always repeating
    the same mistakes."
